action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P125 taps the centre of a ZStack twice. Red is declared first with zIndex 2 and
# must be on top, so the first tap must reach red; after "Drop zIndex" every zIndex
# is 0 and the second tap must reach blue, the last declared. The label at the
# centre does not take hits, so it only aims the tap.
#
# expect: log-contains P125 PASS
#
# P125 點擊 ZStack 中心兩次。紅色最先宣告、zIndex 2,必須在最上面，所以第一次點擊必須到達紅色;「Drop zIndex」
# 之後每個 zIndex 都是 0,第二次點擊必須到達最後宣告的藍色。中心的標籤不接受點擊，只用來瞄準。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P125 render,android
taplabel,,,,,Tap zIndex stack,,must reach red (zIndex 2),android
sleep,,,,,,800000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Drop zIndex,,every zIndex back to 0,android
sleep,,,,,,800000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Tap zIndex stack,,must reach blue (declared last),android
sleep,,,,,,2000000,let the verdict show,android
